   {
    "text": "Eligibility Criteria for fresh engagement (As",
    "page": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "The officer should have retired from the Bank’s service only on attaining superannuation at the age of 60 years",
    "page": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Officers should have good track record of performance and thorough knowledge of Bank’s systems and procedures.",
    "page": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "No punishment/ penalty (Censure or higher) should have been inflicted on the official during the five years of his service preceding to his/her retirement.",
    "page": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "The applicant should have been retired as on the date of submitting of the application",
    "page": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Shortlisting: -Mere fulfilling minimum qualification and experience will not vest any right in candidate for being called for interview",
    "page": 1
   },
